WEBVTT

00:16:29.901 --> 00:16:31.570
And yeah, you know what?

00:16:31.987 --> 00:16:36.324
It's very likely that my boys
may not choose business ownership

00:16:36.366 --> 00:16:37.826
when they grow up.

00:16:37.868 --> 00:16:39.161
And that’s OK.

00:16:39.745 --> 00:16:43.915
Because whether a child chooses
to build a company

00:16:43.915 --> 00:16:45.917
or become an employee,

00:16:45.959 --> 00:16:47.169
it doesn't matter,

00:16:47.169 --> 00:16:53.216
because every kid needs to learn
how to think like an entrepreneur.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:56.344
And the sooner we do this as parents,

00:16:56.386 --> 00:17:01.183
create an environment at home
where they have the opportunity